{"id":"d363e181512f2d28","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-full-omega-model.md","title":"二阶算术的满ω模型真值","display":"df-full-omega-model — 二阶算术的满ω模型真值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-full-omega-model","aliases":["72-df-full-omega-model"],"display":"df-full-omega-model — 二阶算术的满ω模型真值","depends_on":["[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]","[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §2.1, print232–234/PDF244–246; local full-standard-model semantics","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-full-omega-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-full-omega-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-full-omega-model — 二阶算术的满ω模型真值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §2.1, print232–234/PDF244–246; local full-standard-model semantics"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_2(E_{\\rm PR})\">\\(\\mathcal L_2(E_{\\rm PR})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{\\rm PR}\">\\(E_{\\rm PR}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_c\">\\(f_c\\)</span> 及其种类和元数取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:V_N\\to\\omega\">\\(\\eta:V_N\\to\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi:V_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\xi:V_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span>。基本函数解释为标准算术，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_c\">\\(f_c\\)</span> 解释为程序解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ c⟧\">\\(⟦ c⟧\\)</span>，关系 &lt; 为标准序；项值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\eta\">\\(v_\\eta\\)</span> 按严格子项递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E_{\\rm PR})\">\\(A,B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E_{\\rm PR})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(E_{\\rm PR})\">\\(t,u\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(E_{\\rm PR})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_N\">\\(x\\in V_N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V_S\">\\(X\\in V_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E_{\\rm PR})\">\\(T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E_{\\rm PR})\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nv_\\eta(x)&amp;:=\\eta(x),\\quad v_\\eta(0):=0,\\quad v_\\eta(St):=v_\\eta(t)+1,\\\\\nv_\\eta(t+u)&amp;:=v_\\eta(t)+v_\\eta(u),\\quad v_\\eta(t\\cdot u):=v_\\eta(t)v_\\eta(u),\\\\\nv_\\eta(f_c(\\vec t))&amp;:=⟦ c⟧(\\langle v_\\eta(t_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(t=u;\\eta,\\xi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow v_\\eta(t)=v_\\eta(u),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(t&lt;u;\\eta,\\xi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow v_\\eta(t)&lt;v_\\eta(u),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(t\\in X;\\eta,\\xi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow v_\\eta(t)\\in\\xi(X),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(\\neg A;\\eta,\\xi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta,\\xi),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(A\\to B;\\eta,\\xi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta,\\xi)\\Rightarrow\\mathsf{OM}(B;\\eta,\\xi)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(\\forall xA;\\eta,\\xi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta[x:=n],\\xi),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(\\forall XA;\\eta,\\xi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall U\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta,\\xi[X:=U]),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models T&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in T\\ \\forall\\eta\\in\\omega^{V_N}\\ \\forall\\xi\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^{V_S}\\ \\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta,\\xi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nv_\\eta(x)&amp;:=\\eta(x),\\quad v_\\eta(0):=0,\\quad v_\\eta(St):=v_\\eta(t)+1,\\\\\nv_\\eta(t+u)&amp;:=v_\\eta(t)+v_\\eta(u),\\quad v_\\eta(t\\cdot u):=v_\\eta(t)v_\\eta(u),\\\\\nv_\\eta(f_c(\\vec t))&amp;:=⟦ c⟧(\\langle v_\\eta(t_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(t=u;\\eta,\\xi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow v_\\eta(t)=v_\\eta(u),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(t&lt;u;\\eta,\\xi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow v_\\eta(t)&lt;v_\\eta(u),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(t\\in X;\\eta,\\xi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow v_\\eta(t)\\in\\xi(X),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(\\neg A;\\eta,\\xi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta,\\xi),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(A\\to B;\\eta,\\xi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta,\\xi)\\Rightarrow\\mathsf{OM}(B;\\eta,\\xi)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(\\forall xA;\\eta,\\xi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta[x:=n],\\xi),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(\\forall XA;\\eta,\\xi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall U\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta,\\xi[X:=U]),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models T&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in T\\ \\forall\\eta\\in\\omega^{V_N}\\ \\forall\\xi\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^{V_S}\\ \\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta,\\xi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两类变量在元理论中确实遍历 ω 与全部子集；这只是一个集合结构的真值定义，不是把满二阶有效性加入有限推导。函数图的单点更新给环境更新。公式语法只含 ¬、→、∀，故这些子句穷尽；∃、∧等先展开其既有宏。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","status":"resolved","id":"1a814f5220a079de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 $\\mathcal L_2(E_{\\rm PR})$；$E_{\\rm PR}$、$f_c$ 及其种类和元数取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]。$\\eta:V_N\\to\\omega$、$\\xi:V_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)$。基本函数解释为标准算术，每个 $f_c$ 解释为程序解释 $⟦ c⟧$，关系 < 为标准序；项值 $v_\\eta$ 按严格子项递归。$A,B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E_{\\rm PR})$，$t,u\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(E_{\\rm PR})$，$x\\in V_N$、$X\\in V_S$，$T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E_{\\rm PR})$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_2(E_{\\rm PR})","display":false},{"tex":"E_{\\rm PR}","display":false},{"tex":"f_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta:V_N\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi:V_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"f_c","display":false},{"tex":"⟦ c⟧","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E_{\\rm PR})","display":false},{"tex":"t,u\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(E_{\\rm PR})","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V_N","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in V_S","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E_{\\rm PR})","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nv_\\eta(x)&:=\\eta(x),\\quad v_\\eta(0):=0,\\quad v_\\eta(St):=v_\\eta(t)+1,\\\\\nv_\\eta(t+u)&:=v_\\eta(t)+v_\\eta(u),\\quad v_\\eta(t\\cdot u):=v_\\eta(t)v_\\eta(u),\\\\\nv_\\eta(f_c(\\vec t))&:=⟦ c⟧(\\langle v_\\eta(t_i)\\rangle_{i<|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(t=u;\\eta,\\xi)&:\\Longleftrightarrow v_\\eta(t)=v_\\eta(u),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(t<u;\\eta,\\xi)&:\\Longleftrightarrow v_\\eta(t)<v_\\eta(u),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(t\\in X;\\eta,\\xi)&:\\Longleftrightarrow v_\\eta(t)\\in\\xi(X),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(\\neg A;\\eta,\\xi)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta,\\xi),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(A\\to B;\\eta,\\xi)&:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta,\\xi)\\Rightarrow\\mathsf{OM}(B;\\eta,\\xi)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(\\forall xA;\\eta,\\xi)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta[x:=n],\\xi),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}(\\forall XA;\\eta,\\xi)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall U\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta,\\xi[X:=U]),\\\\\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models T&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in T\\ \\forall\\eta\\in\\omega^{V_N}\\ \\forall\\xi\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^{V_S}\\ \\mathsf{OM}(A;\\eta,\\xi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true